# Editor / IDE (머신별 절대경로 포함 - VSCode ESP-IDF 확장이 idf.currentSetup, clangd.path 등을 여기 저장함)
.vscode/
.claude/

# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Directory metadata
.directory

# Temporary files
*~
*.swp
*.swo
*.bak
*.tmp

# Log files
*.log

# Build artifacts and directories
**/build/
build/
*.o
*.a
*.out
*.exe # For any host-side utilities compiled on Windows

# ESP-IDF specific build outputs
*.bin
*.elf
*.map
flasher_args.json # Generated in build directory
sdkconfig.old
sdkconfig

# ESP-IDF dependencies
# For older versions or manual component management
/components/.idf/
**/components/.idf/
# For modern ESP-IDF component manager
managed_components/
# If ESP-IDF tools are installed/referenced locally to the project
.espressif/

# CMake generated files
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
install_manifest.txt
CTestTestfile.cmake

# Python environment files
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
dist/

# Virtual environment folders
venv/
.venv/
env/

# Language Servers
.clangd/
.ccls-cache/
compile_commands.json

# Windows specific
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# User-specific configuration files
*.user
*.workspace # General workspace files, can be from various tools
*.suo       # Visual Studio Solution User Options
*.sln.docstates # Visual Studio

# FHSS 팀 공유 비밀(HMAC-SHA256 hop_seed 파생용). EMBED_TXTFILES로 빌드에
# 박혀서 커밋 대상이 아님 — components/fhss_audio_adapter/secret_seed.txt.example
# 참고해서 각자 준비(README.md "빌드 전 준비" 참고). *.txt로 폴더째 무시해서
# secret_seed.txt뿐 아니라 사본/백업 파일("secret_seed (사본).txt" 등)도
# 실수로 커밋되지 않게 함 — .example은 확장자가 .txt가 아니라 안 걸림.
/components/fhss_audio_adapter/*.txt
